# 3D Scanning and Surface Area Measurements

## Prepared by: Coral Reef and Ocean Health Research Group; Adapted from Dr. Sarah Daveis Lab at Boston University
## Last Updated: 23 April, 2024
## Ppre-requisite SOP: NA
##Safety Precautions:
* REQUIRED PPE - Enclosed Shoes

### Purpose: 
The surface area of the corals will be measured using a 3D scanner (EinScan-SE). More recent work has shown that 3D-scanned images of the coral 
provide a more accurate surface area measurement needed to standardize physiological measurements.

